    </item>
    <item>
      <headword id="d0e724">crann Gàidhealach</headword>
      <description>all iron 2 horse plough with cast iron mould board (sgiath). Had wooden handles locally made.</description>
    </item>
	<item>
	  <headword id="idola215">[plough]</headword>
	  <description>Both metal swing ploughs not controlled for depth. Driver had to control depth.</description>
	</item>
    <item><headword id="d0e741" type="heading" level="h2">(b) Parts of a plough in detail</headword></item>
