    </item>
    <item>
      <headword id="d0e755">bonn a’ chruinn</headword>
      <description>the head to which the sock is attached.</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <headword id="d0e764">sgiath (f), sgiathan (pl)</headword>
      <description>the furrow board or mould board.</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <headword id="d0e773">druim a’ chruinn</headword>
      <description>the part to which furrow board and earth board are attached.</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <headword id="d0e782">barr an t-suic</headword>
